<title>USA: HCIA Inc Q3 net loss with charges vs profit.</title>
<headline>HCIA Inc Q3 net loss with charges vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF OPERATIONS</p>
<p>			(in thousands except per-share data)</p>
<p>				Three months ended  Nine months ended</p>
<p>	   September 30, 1996 &amp; 1995  September 30, 1996 &amp; 1995</p>
<p>			     1996	   1995     1996	  1995</p>
<p> Revenue		 $18,684     $13,220   $49,402    $34,225</p>
<p>Operating income</p>
<p>  (loss)		(39,380)	 2,489  (38,214)	4,833</p>
<p> Interest income	   244	   382	 811	  799</p>
<p> Interest expense	  294	    65	 437	  104</p>
<p> Net Income (loss)  (43,233)	 1,618  (42,269)	3,125</p>
<p>Net Income (loss)</p>
<p>  per share	     (4.13)	  0.19    (4.43)	 0.41</p>
<p>Shares used in per share</p>
<p>  calculation	   10,466	 8,586     9,533	7,661</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 net income for the quarter and nine-month period includes one-time charges related to acquired in-process research and development costs. Excluding these charges, net income was $0.12 per share for the quarter and $0.49 per share for the nine months ended September 30, 1996.</p>
